# Granio Tribunal — local environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in values.
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit your actual key.

# ─── OpenAI (Prompt Forge proxy — server-side only) ──────────────────────────
# Read by server.js via dotenv. Never exposed to the browser or bundled by Vite.
# Start the proxy with: npm run server
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
